-- LocalScript -> StarterPlayer > StarterPlayerScripts
-- PC: Q = activate | E = ghost burst | F = fortified ankles | Z = implants menu
-- Controller: Y = activate | X = ghost burst | B = fortified ankles | Mobile: on-screen buttons
-- Press activate again while active to cancel early (saves Humanity).
--
-- NEW in v8:
--  * GHOST BURST UPGRADES (new "GHOST BURST" tab): more clones, faster hops, shorter cooldown.
--  * Ghost Burst path is much straighter now (BURST_ZIGZAG was 3 studs, now 1).
--  * FORTIFIED ANKLES (new implant, "ANKLES" tab, costs points to install):
--      - [F] on the ground = huge jump. No Sandevistan needed, it's just a jump (not a mode).
--        Upgrading your JUMPER Sandevistan adds a little extra jump power to it.
--      - [F] while in the air = the ankles pull you to the nearest wall you could collide with and you
--        wall walk on it for 7 seconds (feet on the wall). Jump or press [F] again to let go.
--      - INCREASED GRIP: brush a wall while airborne (moving toward it) and you grip it by yourself, no button,
--        for 4.5 seconds. It re-arms when you touch the ground. (CONFIG.ANKLE_AUTO_GRIP = false turns it off.)
--      - Two upgrades: LEG POWER (higher jump) and GRIP (longer wall walks).
--
-- v7: single ghost palette, menu no longer closes on outside click, earn upgrade points, Ghost Burst skill.
-- v6: upgrades + degrading, system upgrades, shared points pool.
-- v5: spine skeleton + implants menu (All-Rounder / Jumper / Speedster).
-- v4: Humanity meter + Cyberpsychosis. v4.1: speed boost follows the game's own speed changes.

